00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.510
- So, we're working right now on
building up the overall strength

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.058
and endurance of it but

00:01:01.058 --> 00:01:03.170
beforehand you 
had a slight tear.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.632
So basically everything we're
doing is to work around the

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:08.368
slight tear while building up
the strength and endurance.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:12.372
- Rare situation where the
left is stronger than the right.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:15.128
Somebody just DM'd me about the
Joe Rogan podcast and he said,

00:01:15.128 --> 00:01:17.144
you know, 
great observation, great guy.

00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:18.245
Very nice note.

00:01:18.245 --> 00:01:19.513
Said, you know, ying yang.

00:01:19.513 --> 00:01:22.177
You've got the yang.

00:01:22.177 --> 00:01:24.597
You're competitive but that
thing that Joe was talking about

00:01:24.597 --> 00:01:27.414
with your daughter and the
basketball and this maybe you need to

00:01:27.414 --> 00:01:28.755
look at the ying and yang.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:29.856
You got to look at both sides.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.325
I don't think people understand.

00:01:31.325 --> 00:01:33.660
I look at both 
sides quite a bit.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.262
I live both sides quite a bit.

00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:37.097
I'm pulling from both sides
quite a bit but here's the

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:41.116
difference when I'm on
the field all-in one way.

00:01:41.116 --> 00:01:45.138
Like everybody wants a 
micro ying and yang but

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.273
that's not how it works.

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:48.442
It's a macro ying and yang.

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.841
On the big picture, 
super balanced.

00:01:50.841 --> 00:01:53.914
But when I'm on the 
fucking field competing,

00:01:53.914 --> 00:01:56.233
you have to go 100.

00:01:56.233 --> 00:01:58.051
Jordan, how do I workout?

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.753
- 100% every time.

00:01:59.753 --> 00:02:03.490
- That's it and I fucking 
hate working out.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.627
But that's the part, you can't
be 50-50 working out,

00:02:05.627 --> 00:02:10.530
50-50 in relationships,
50-50 in your escapism,

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.969
50-50 in the way you play.

00:02:11.969 --> 00:02:13.600
That's why everybody's average.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.103
You have to be 
macro ying and yang,

00:02:16.103 --> 00:02:18.305
micro all-in one
way or the other.

00:02:18.305 --> 00:02:20.640
Right here is good, man.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.358
- Thanks man.

00:02:21.358 --> 00:02:23.127
- Got it?
- Yeah.

00:02:23.127 --> 00:02:25.125
- Got it?

